v2.1 ViBu Edition - Candidate Release

New: Disabled automatically empty cash register. It only works with single cash register environment.

New: 5 cash registers are deployed by default. So, RULE_EXISTENCE_4 was disabled: This trigger is not created
	tg_CashRegister_before_insert_RULE_EXISTENCE_4

New: At database level for the time being, a counter can be configured for the payments originating in it to be deposited
	in a specified cash register, and the corresponding changes to be withdrawn from it as well.

New: At database level for the time being, a counter can be stocked by a cost center. So, FUNCTION soberano."fn_Order_make"(
	orderid integer, itemid integer, description character varying, runs numeric, loginname character varying) was changed
	in the way if the order's counter is stocked by a cost center, that cost center has precedence over the product's cost
	center.

New: EAN-8 and EAN-12 barcode validation added.

New: Some autodrop comboboxes optimized to not load the entire set of items from database. For example: cmbItemToOrder and cmbCustomer.

New: Custom report 5 added: IPV (Sales (ventas) Inventory (producción) Production (inventario) in English)

New: In new_product.zul and new_acquirable_material.zul, now is possible to scan a bar code and if the product is included in
	open4goods-data-open database, or in https://go-upc.com/, the name field is filled out automatically. An Internet connection
	is required for go-upc.
	
New: Upon collecting an order, if soberano."fn_Order_collect" returned a positive query result, it is assumed that number
	is an order id, likely of a new one created automatically from within soberano."fn_Order_collect" for reducing the 
	work load of the salesclerk/checker who wouldn't have to manually create a new order every time it close some. This 
	feature would prevent to print the ticket after collecting. The change was introduced in method 
	CashRegisterCollectButtonComposer.btnCollect_onClick

Fix: With RAW printing mode, after collecting an order, the ticket encoded in the URL wasn't printed. Solved not using
	that URL field to get the content to print
	
Fix: With RAW printing mode, upon collecting an order, the cash drawer was not opened. Solved it.

Fix: In public class ProduceButtonComposer, back to the previous approach of printing three feed lines at the end of the 
	production allocation ticket. This is because in RAW printing (no CUPS) computer's printer settings aren't available 
	to control that, and RAW is the most popular printing method. An improvement could be to add a setting to printer 
	profile configuration controlling such behaviour.
	
Fix: Inventory recalculation by means of pl/pgsql FUNCTION fn_Stock_recalculateInventoryFrom was wrong for the cases when the quantity
	in origin warehouse felt to zero or below. For example, an inventory operation moving a quantity of 1000 or more 1500 of an item with
	a stock quantity in the origin of 1000.
		
